{"obs_mqhil37i_9627c8157860":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqhil37i_9627c8157860","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"path\":\"AGENTS.md\"}","duration_ms":1268,"error_message":null,"is_error":false,"result_preview":"{\"content\": \"1|# agentmemory â€” Agent Instructions\\n2|\\n3|## Architecture\\n4|\\n5|agentmemory is a persistent memory system for AI coding agents, built on iii-engine's three primitives (Worker/Function/Trigger). Everything goes through `registerFunction`/`registerTrigger`/`sdk.trigger()` â€” never bypass iii-engine with standalone SQLite or in-process alternatives.\\n6|\\n7|- **Engine**: iii-sdk (WebSocket to iii-engine on port 49134)\\n8|- **State**: File-based SQLite via iii-engine's StateModule (`./data/state_store.db`)\\n9|- **Build**: TypeScript â†’ ESM via tsdown, output to `dist/`\\n10|- **Test**: vitest (`npm test` excludes integration tests)\\n11|\\n12|## Consistency Rules\\n13|\\n14|**When adding or removing MCP tools, you MUST update ALL of the following:**\\n15|1. `src/mcp/tools-registry.ts` â€” tool definition + `getAllTools()` array\\n16|2. `src/mcp/server.ts` â€” handler case in the `mcp::tools::call` switch\\n17|3. `src/triggers/api.ts` â€” REST endpoint registration\\n18|4. `src/index.ts` â€” fu...","status":"ok","task_id":"20260616_221906_014eb3","tool_call_id":"call_3f1f1d43517348da939f6438","tool_name":"read_file","turn_id":"20260616_221906_014eb3:20260616_221906_014eb3:47200a42"},"sessionId":"20260616_221906_014eb3","timestamp":"2026-06-17T03:31:32.858523+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqhinqwm_71213be102f8":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqhinqwm_71213be102f8","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"code\":\"import subprocess\\nimport json\\nimport os\\n\\nenv_path = os.path.expanduser(\\\"~/.agentmemory/.env\\\")\\nsecret = \\\"\\\"\\nwith open(env_path, \\\"r\\\") as f:\\n    for line in f:\\n        if line.startswith(\\\"AGENTMEMORY_SECRET=\\\"):\\n            secret = line.split(\\\"=\\\", 1)[1].strip()\\n            break\\n\\nresult = subprocess.run(\\n    [\\\"curl\\\", \\\"-s\\\", \\\"-H\\\", f\\\"Authorization: Bearer {secret}\\\", \\\"http://127.0.0.1:3111/agentmemory/sessions\\\"],\\n    capture_output=True, text=True\\n)\\ndata = js...","duration_ms":12404,"error_message":null,"is_error":false,"result_preview":"{\"status\": \"success\", \"output\": \"[\\n  {\\n    \\\"cwd\\\": \\\"/Volumes/AI/agentmemory\\\",\\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"ses_1781665979_8013\\\",\\n    \\\"observationCount\\\": 0,\\n    \\\"project\\\": \\\"/Volumes/AI/agentmemory\\\",\\n    \\\"startedAt\\\": \\\"2026-06-17T03:12:59.506Z\\\",\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"active\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"cwd\\\": \\\"/Volumes/AI/agentmemory\\\",\\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"ses_1779528726_79703\\\",\\n    \\\"observationCount\\\": 0,\\n    \\\"project\\\": \\\"/Volumes/AI/agentmemory\\\",\\n    \\\"startedAt\\\": \\\"2026-05-23T09:32:06.145Z\\\",\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"active\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"cwd\\\": \\\"/Volumes/AI/agentmemory\\\",\\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"ses_1781667053_32018\\\",\\n    \\\"observationCount\\\": 0,\\n    \\\"project\\\": \\\"/Volumes/AI/agentmemory\\\",\\n    \\\"startedAt\\\": \\\"2026-06-17T03:30:53.016Z\\\",\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"active\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"cwd\\\": \\\"/Volumes/AI/agentmemory\\\",\\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"ses_1781666875_27187\\\",\\n    \\\"observationCount\\\": 0,\\n    \\\"project\\\": \\\"/Volumes/AI/agentmemory\\\",\\n    \\\"startedAt\\\": \\\"2026-06-17T03:27:55.333Z\\\",\\n    \\\"s...","status":"ok","task_id":"20260616_221906_014eb3","tool_call_id":"call_336e72dd4b7c4723aadaf607","tool_name":"execute_code","turn_id":"20260616_221906_014eb3:20260616_221906_014eb3:c53cf2cc"},"sessionId":"20260616_221906_014eb3","timestamp":"2026-06-17T03:33:36.882110+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mqhio58m_73dc4a9621aa":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mqhio58m_73dc4a9621aa","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -H \\\"Authorization: 